## Sprint 19 Track A — Invoice-backed flow + automatic_tax wiring

S16 shipped direct PaymentIntent flow. Stripe SDK v22 removed `automatic_tax: { enabled: true }` from PaymentIntent.create params. Solution per Sage S19: use Invoice-backed flow when studio has tax registrations — Invoice supports automatic_tax + emits tax_breakdown authoritatively.

